L on two paths; full production-invocation FAIL (26 regressions /78 new unresolved, coverage partial). ABM diagnostic FAIL is separate. **P41 not_established**. Complete red/error/skipped/unavailable outputs are retained.\n\n[Final closeout receipt](https://github.com/DenisKopylov/polisyos/blob/codex/e02-F-closeout-20261006/policy-engine/docs/research/e02-cloud-test-plan/implementation-handoffs/F/continuation-closeout-20261006.json) resolves independent frozen-packet validation and links all37 components /12 topics, cleanup custody and exact minimal owner packets. Actual Runtime verifier/current context/fresh challenge, distinct PDC semantic identity, B56 admitted competing-study budget, broad policy/temporal inputs, LA-035 optimizer/normative intent and Lex current local-law inputs remain UNRUN/limited/held as applicable. Production data stayed local; no authority or welfare law was invented. Four historical175c provenance-only refs remain unavailable UNRUN and decide none of the35 verdicts.\n\nThis draft is a source/evidence handoff for G review. G must replay affected composed consumers and packaging on its exact integrated SHA; neither package installation nor this source-only receipt is combined integration acceptance. No main publication or history rewrite is requested. Native Trash is unavailable; precise conditional cleanup candidates are preserved without permanent deletion.","created_at":"2026-10-06T11:52:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T20:05:48Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c14916bd093c33bc9674a0abc64d723322bf4019","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11662988108,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQzItzs8AAAACtysTTA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DenisKopylov/polisyos/labels/kind:docs","name":"kind:docs","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12552287076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQzItzs8AAAAC7CyzZA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DenisKopylov/polisy